      00 00 00 37
      00 04
      dc 10 cc 10
      ec 10 db 10
      0b 0b 0b 0b
      04 02 05 02

      34
      00 00 00 09
      00 00 00 39
      00 04
      f0 4d f1 4b
      f1 4c f1 4d
      00 00 00 00
      00 00 00 00

      34
      00 00 00 09
      00 00 00 36
      00 06
      8b 4b 8a 47
      8a 48 8a 49
      8a 4a 8a 4b
      00 00 00 00
      12 12 00 00
      00 00 00 0e


  Unknown  (0x35) -- 11 bytes

    Probably related to chunks, given packet ID and proximity to other chunk
    packets.

      Example packet

